ろえる","kr":"물고기 찾기"},"objective_summary_i18n":{"cn":"阿尔听说货车被抢，反常地表示不追究。他让大家先把鱼铺摊子要卖的鱼找出来，和他一起找鱼吧。","en":"Surprisingly, Al decides to drop the issue when he learns about the robbery. He wants everyone to get the spare stock ready for the stall. Lend him a hand.","jp":"アルは貨物車が強盗に遭ったことを知っても、珍しく追求しなかった。今は屋台に並べる魚をそろえることが最優先で、あなたたちにも手伝ってほしいとお願いした。","kr":"아르는 화물차가 도둑맞은 사실을 듣고도 쫓아가지 않고 일단 가게에서 팔 물고기를 찾아야 한다고 했다. 그와 물고기를 찾아보자."},"assembly_key":"season_2/season_2/reputation_quest/12010503"}},"ep2/quest_story_12242050":{"objective:12010512:1:4":{"step":"12010512:1:4","activity_type":"CardPlay","title":"Card puzzle","start":"scripted","evidence":{"condition_field":"ClientFinishCondition","condition":"ed.ConditionX.C_MiniGameSuccess(\"CardPlay\",141)","puzzle_type":"10","group":"141","launches":[{"step":"12010512:1:3","field":"FinishAction","expression":"ed.ActionX.C_StartMiniPlay(\"CardPlay\",141) and ed.ActionX.AddStates(403772,\"CMark_1\") and ed.ActionX.SetWeather(4,2,\"HeavyRain\")"}],"menu_offers":[{"id":"128","object":"403772","guard":"ed.ConditionX.HasState(403772,\"CMark_1\")","action":"ed.ActionX.C_StartMiniPlay(\"CardPlay\",141)"}],"object_launches":[]},"gate":{"kind":"literal","value":true},"position":"objective","objective_title_i18n":{"cn":"搬运木材","en":"Move the Wood","jp":"木材を積み込む","kr":"목재 운반하기"},"objective_summary_i18n":{"cn":"搬运木材途中忽然下起了雨，必须赶在下雨之前赶紧把木材运完。","en":"It suddenly starts raining while you are moving the wood. You need to finish up before it turns into a downpour.","jp":"木材を運ぶ途中で、突然雨が降り出した。急いで木材を貨物車に積み込もう。","kr":"목재를 운반하는 중 갑자기 비가 내리기 시작했다. 비가 쏟아지기 전에 서둘러 목재를 모두 운반해야 한다."},"assembly_key":"season_2/season_2/reputation_quest/12010512"}},"ep2/quest_story_12244081":{"objective:12010514:1:6":{"step":"12010514:1:6","activity_type":"Ducky","title":"Herding","start":"conditional_menu","evidence":{"condition_field":"ClientFinishCondition","condition":"ed.ConditionX.C_MiniGameSuccess(\"Ducky\",16)","puzzle_type":"8","group":"16","launches":[],"menu_offers":[{"id":